    "describe_ch": "透過讓學生研讀《羅密歐與茱麗葉》相關文本、影片及歌曲，帶同學初步了解莎翁，並對舞台劇有所了解，思考若將十六世紀文本搬至現代該如何改編及設計。",
    "describe_eh": "Students dive into the text of Romeo and Juliet and songs related to it as an initial understanding of Shakespeare and the 16th-century musical theatre tradition. The course also guides students to explore how a 16th-century play can be reimagined and adapted for a modern performance through creative redesign.",
